      "headline": "GM & Technology Sector Head @ Wipro",
      "about": "Accomplished Technology & IT Business Leader with 21 years of experience in P&L, Sales & Engineering.\nTrack record of driving vision, delivering results, and transformation in publicly listed & private companies. A team-oriented leader with a relentless focus on Customer Centricity, Top Line and Bottom Line Growth, Client Acquisition, and Operations.\nBuilt and managed P&L portfolios up to $120 Mil. Scaled operations & led diverse teams in 26 countries.\nA trusted partner to Enterprise CxOs & Business Leaders in their Digital & transformation journeys across Cloud, Data/AI, Embedded, Mobile/IoT spanning large Deals and M&As.\n\nHarman International is a global technology leader in Automotive, Lifestyle Audio, and Digital Transformation (Software Solutions Division). Legendary house of brands (Harman Kardon, JBL, Infinity, Revel, and more)\nWe're the global leaders in innovation with 3 Grammy awards, 2 Academy Awards, 51 Design awards & 5700 Patents. Employing over 29000 Employees worldwide across US, Europe & Asia\n\nAs Regional Vice President for Digital Transformation (Software Solutions-Divison), I'm responsible for leading and managing customer acquisition and account management teams. Nurturing Executive Customer Relationships catering to Hi-Tech, ISV, SaaS/Cloud, Communications, Healthcare, Semiconductor, IoT, Wearables, Automotive, and Platform players across Fortune 1000 and large enterprises.\nSigned the most profitable and highest ACV deal in the history of Harman. Onboarded more than 300 Enterprise customers in the last 3 years.\nStrategic Deal Award (2020) | Sales Person of the Year (2018) | President's Club (2018) | Achiever's Club (2017) | CEO Club Award (2016), Achievers' Award (2016) | Chairman's Club award (2015) | President's Club award (2014) | Large Deal award (2013) | Salesperson of the Year award (2010)",
