            {
              "description": {
                "type": "textComponent",
                "text": "As VP-Regional Business Head for Digital Transformation (Software Solutions Division), i'm responsible for $100Million Business portfolio and P&L spanning Western US, Canada and Latin America, one of the largest regions in DTS BU. My team is responsible for acquiring and managing Fortune 1000 and Large enterprises headquartered in the region, driving strategic engagements in Design led Digital Transformation, Product Engineering and Software Solutions, leveraging Harman/ Samsung's Portfolio of Solutions, IP Assets and Brands. Customer base comprises Fortune 2000 Clientele, Large enterprises, Hi-growth Mid size companies & start-ups. I lead and mentor direct teams across US, Latin America and Asia to scale these engagements into Platinum Customer Accounts supported by an agile global footprint. I sponsor and Nurture Executive Customer Relationships spanning Hi-Tech/ Cloud/ SaaS/ISV, Healthcare & Lifesciences, Communications and Semiconductor, Automotive, Industrial, OEMs, IoT. I'm responsible for identifying emerging growth areas and creating new Lines of Business, organically and inorganically. Have been part of multiple strategic initiates, M&As and integrations.\n\nStrategic Deal (2022) | Largest Deal (2020) | Sales Person of the Year (2018) | President's Club (2018) | Achiever's Club (2017) | CEO's Club (2016), Achievers' Award (2016), Chairman's Club (2015), President's Club (2014), Large Deal award (2014), Chairman's Club (2013) | Sales Person of the Year award (2010) \n\nWe help clients co-create innovative Digital product and solutions for the connected world focusing on SaaS, Cloud, AI/ML, Mobile and IoT. Harman offers a legendary portfolio of Software & Hardware Products, Solutions, Platforms, and Services for Hi-Tech, ISV, SaaS, HealthCare, Fitness, Mobile, IoT, Semiconductor, Automotive, Telcos, BFSI and Hospitality Industry. Headquartered in Connecticut, US, Harman operates across 50 countries with a global employee base of 30000+."
